F292                             ; =============================================================================
F292                             ;  Handlers that must start in the second range (unchecked build).
F292                             ; =============================================================================
F292                             ; "(" ( flag -- ): true pushes the block start and enters; false skips to
F292                             ; the matching ")".
F292   EC C1        H_OPEN:   LDD   ,U++   
F294                          IF   (1-CHECKED)*(1-QK)   
                              BEQ   skip   ; tail call: skip ends in RTS
F294                          ENDIF      
