F2A0   4F                     CLRA      
F2A1   E6 84        CF1:      LDB   ,X   
F2A3   ED C4                  STD   ,U   
F2A5   39                     RTS      
F2A6                             ; ")" ( flag -- ): true jumps back to the block start (and keeps it); false
F2A6                             ; drops it and carries on.
