F30A   E3 C4                  ADDD   ,U   
F30C   ED C4        ST:       STD   ,U   
F30E   39                     RTS      
F30F                             ; "-" has two jobs: directly before a digit it starts a negative number.
F30F                             ; (The checked build has it in the tail, near negnum: its report would be
F30F                             ; in the way here.)
F30F                          IF   1-CHECKED   
                    H_SUB:    JSR   isdig   
                              BLO   negnum   
                              LDD   2,U   
                              SUBD   ,U++   
                              BRA   st   
F30F                          ENDIF      
F30F                             ; "!" ( n addr -- ) is "." with the high byte stored first. The cell in
F30F                             ; memory is little-endian.
